### Quick Start (React + Next.js + Tailwind)

```bash
npx create-next-app@latest my-ecommerce --typescript
cd my-ecommerce
npm install axios @tanstack/react-query tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
# Configure tailwind.config.js
# Add Tailwind directives to globals.css
# Add React Query provider in _app.tsx
# Create pages/products, pages/products/[id], pages/cart
# Add components, services, store
# Run dev: npm run dev
```

That’s it! You now have a fully‑featured, scalable e‑commerce frontend ready for production. Happy coding!
